    Simplify encrypt and mask workflows to DistSQL only (#38811)
    
    * Reduce duplicated MCP E2E coverage
    
    Add focused harness unit tests for deterministic MCP payload,
    model-contract, and baseline assertion behavior.
    
    Trim programmatic MCP E2E tests that duplicated unit-covered
    handler, protocol, recovery, metadata, and contract branches while
    keeping runtime boundary coverage for HTTP, sessions, Docker-backed
    metadata/SQL, workflow state, and redaction behavior.
    
    Document the test-layering decision with speckit spec, plan, tasks,
    and verification notes.
    
    * Simplify encrypt and mask workflows to DistSQL only
    
    Remove OSS encrypt workflow steps that planned physical DDL, derived columns,
    indexes, and extra execution guidance. Align encrypt and mask MCP workflows with
    a strict DistSQL-only contract so they only produce rule DistSQL for Proxy.
    
    Also update Speckit documents, prompts, descriptors, and tests to reflect the
    new boundary.
    
